store("caller_rule_reasoning",[
{id:"geometry",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[3,3],quote:"Status cells are 16 by 16 logical pixels. ... Ready and Retry are static images."},obligation:"One static 16x16 image; exact check composition otherwise open.",literal_delta:"Exact dimensions/single frame/no strip/no extra canvas implement cell and static source, without narrower subject geometry.",alternative:"A 16x16 static asymmetrical check with a backing disc must pass geometry; a 64x16 four-frame strip fails the actual Ready obligation.",disposition:"Keep."},
{id:"transparent-background",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[3,3],quote:"Use transparent backgrounds"},obligation:"Transparent background; partial subject alpha and intentional backing motifs remain open.",literal_delta:"Old 'no opaque ... box or fringe fills the cell' risks rejecting an intentional backing plate as subject rather than matte.",alternative:"A clearly readable asymmetrical blue-accented check on an intentional small disc, surrounded by transparent pixels, satisfies source but can fail a blanket plate/box exclusion.",disposition:"Require transparent exterior and no accidental matte; expressly allow intentional subject backing and partial alpha."},
{id:"ready-meaning",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[9,9],quote:"Ready must visibly use a check mark with asymmetrical arms to convey successful completion."},obligation:"Asymmetrical-arm check conveys success; no fixed stroke, ratio, highlight, centering or backing.",literal_delta:"Contrasting completion with activity/failure/pause/Start is a semantic expert interpretation; must be sample-alone, not require missing family assets.",alternative:"Outlined or thin readable asymmetrical check on a disc remains valid; equal-arm plus or activity loop fails explicit meaning. Actual future sibling comparison cannot be a first-sample prerequisite.",disposition:"Keep explicit motif and success, distinguish candidate semantic assessment from deferred family comparisons."},
{id:"readability-1x-3x",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[3,3],quote:"readable silhouettes ... Inspect at 1x and 3x nearest display scale on the actual dark panel."},obligation:"Readable silhouette at both scales; panel comes from src/queue-view.ts line9 #172336.",literal_delta:"No essential detail lost is an operational reading of readability, not demand all decorative pixels remain visible.",alternative:"A check whose silhouette reads clearly but subtle nonessential highlight merges with panel remains valid; a check lost against panel fails.",disposition:"Keep essential silhouette scope; no exact palette or all-detail contrast threshold."},
{id:"cool-blue-accent",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[3,3],quote:"the existing UI's cool blue accent; a fixed palette is not required"},obligation:"Use recognizable existing cool blue accent; source does not require blue to dominate or exact #70b9ed.",literal_delta:"Old 'dominant colour treatment' adds extent/dominance absent from source.",alternative:"Mostly neutral check/plate with a legible cool blue accent uses the requested accent while its dominant fill is neutral; old literal rule can reject it.",disposition:"Remove dominance; retain perceptible blue accent relation, no exact hue/count/coverage threshold."},
{id:"sample-pixel-craft",source:{path:"BRIEF.md",lines:[3,5],quote:"Create coherent pixel-art status assets ... propose a representative status sample before expanding the family."},obligation:"Pixel-art quality and plausible extensibility need expert assessment; exact cluster/edge construction is not owner-specified.",literal_delta:"Old clean clusters/no noisy strays/blur/downscaled artifacts is expert sample criterion. Blanket isolation/partial-alpha/process ban would exceed basis.",alternative:"Deliberate isolated sparkle or partial-alpha edge that preserves a readable pixel-art check can satisfy source; automatically rejecting either imposes a recipe. Art made by resampling but with no visible defect cannot be rejected for an inferred route.",disposition:"Retain scoped expert output quality, distinguish accidental defects from deliberate detail and prohibit route inference; no family approval implied."}
]);text("Prepared independent source obligations and discriminating alternatives for all six rejection criteria.");

